WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.710
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:02.990
We're all MIT musicians.

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.960
We're here to build
connection with the people

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.620
here, understanding the
importance of the Amazon.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.460
This trip expands the
scope of what music means.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.770
It's living the piece
of music and you

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:17.900
don't get to feel that
unless you put yourself

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.210
in new experiences
and get yourself out

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.910
of your comfort zone.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.280
The language is so
inherently rhythmic.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.620
The culture is all
about dance and music

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.258
and that flows into
everything that they do.

00:00:30.258 --> 00:00:31.175
It's all encompassing.

00:00:31.175 --> 00:00:32.719
You know, pulls you in.

00:00:32.719 --> 00:00:36.069
[MUSIC PLAYING]

